## What the package holds

- `icons/{{ name }}.css` and `icons/{{ name }}.min.css`: the stylesheet of the icon font, with one class per icon
- `icons/{{ name }}.scss`: the same stylesheet for Sass, with the folder of the font and the map of the icons as variables
- {{# each formats }}`icons/{{ ../name }}.{{ this }}`{{# unless @last }}, {{/ unless }}{{/ each }}: the icon font, which the stylesheets load from their own folder
- `icons/{{ name }}.svg`: the SVG sprite, one `<symbol>` per icon with the name of the icon as its `id`
- `icons/{{ name }}.json`: the code point of each icon in the font, by name
- `svgs/<name>.svg`: one optimized file per icon

